	(text "CP2102N-A02, bus-powered. VREGIN = VBUS, internal LDO -> VIO_3V3 (3.3V I/O, up to 100 mA available)\nVBUS sense divider R1/R2 per datasheet; ~{RST} 1k pull-up\nUART TXD/RXD + RTS/CTS/DTR to hierarchy; unused GPIO left NC\nA01 revision is EOL - order A02 only"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
